		(descr "DS3231 + AT24C32 RTC module (ZS-042 type, CR2032 holder). Plug-in daughterboard on 1x6 female header, 2.54mm pitch. Body 40x20x10mm MEASURED on the real part 2026-07-31: the 40mm axis runs PERPENDICULAR to the pin row (module extends 40mm away from the through-holes), 20mm along the pin row, 10mm thick incl. pin tips. Body outline is a keepout so placement accounts for the real size. Pads 1-6 = 32K/SQW/SCL/SDA/VCC/GND. Pin row assumed centered on the 20mm edge and inset 1mm from it - confirm with calipers if placement gets tight.")
